; font_outline_color/outline_size — the ONE variable no other Label fixture
; sets. The MSDF text engine composites the outline into the SAME mesh as
; the fill, at a second distance threshold (`msdfMaterial.ts`'s own doc); a
; regression that sizes the fill's own coverage correctly while drawing no
; border, or a border of the wrong width, is invisible in a diff that only
; checks the fill glyph's own ink.

